          <h3>Uta Hagen Technique</h3>
          <p>Skills sessions on the first Tuesday of every month, 6–7.30pm (second Tuesday in January). Each session works through one of Uta Hagen's 10 exercises, so over the year you build a complete, actor-focused process. Join at any session; booking required.</p>
          <div class="cost"><b>£14 / £20 / £26</b><span>Per session · pay what you can</span></div>
